I installed Debian on PWS 500a and it worked fine without problems.

Switch to SRM console and set os_type to unix just to be sure.

But I suspect it could be a memory problem.
On my PWS, a bank of memory (a pair) became faulty at one time and I had
to replace it (I had a spare pair for replacing)
Try removing the memory modules, clean pins on modules and slots and
reseat them.
If you have more than two modules, try some combinations starting with 2
modules.

